{%- comment -%}
  Moon Ridge — Hat Education "Shop" CTA

  Renders directly beneath the article hero image. Most readers never reach
  the bottom of a long guide, so the primary shop action lives here instead.

  Destinations come from the article metafield `custom.shop_cta_collections`
  (list.collection_reference, use one or two). Button labels are generated from
  the collection titles — nothing to write per article. With the metafield
  empty this falls back to a single "Shop Hats" button, so the block is never
  blank and never broken.

  Keep the line here distinct from the announcement bar copy — they appear
  within a screen of each other on an article page.

  Colour tokens (--he-ink, --he-accent) are inherited from .he-article in
  snippets/hat-education-article.liquid. Root font is 10px (62.5%), so
  1rem = 10px here.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign cta_collections = article.metafields.custom.shop_cta_collections.value
  assign hub_url = '/pages/shop-hats'
  if pages['shop-hats'] != blank
    assign hub_url = pages['shop-hats'].url
  endif
-%}

<aside class="he-shopcta" aria-label="Shop hats">
  <p class="he-shopcta__eyebrow">Find Yours</p>
  <p class="he-shopcta__line">The hats behind this guide.</p>

  <div class="he-shopcta__actions">
    {%- if cta_collections != blank and cta_collections.size > 0 -%}
      {%- for cta_collection in cta_collections limit: 2 -%}
        <a class="he-shopcta__btn" href="{{ cta_collection.url }}?ref=hat-ed">
          Shop {{ cta_collection.title | escape }}
        </a>
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- else -%}
      <a class="he-shopcta__btn" href="{{ hub_url }}?ref=hat-ed">Shop Hats</a>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</aside>

<style>
  .he-shopcta {
    max-width: 69rem; /* matches .he-article__body column */
    margin: 0 auto 3.4rem;
    padding: 2.4rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(49, 33, 16, 0.14);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(49, 33, 16, 0.14);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .he-shopcta__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.7rem;
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--he-accent, #c5a059);
  }

  .he-shopcta__line {
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--he-ink, #312110);
  }

  .he-shopcta__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .he-shopcta__btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: 21rem;
    padding: 1.2rem 2.2rem;
    background: var(--he-ink, #312110);
    border: 1px solid var(--he-ink, #312110);
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .he-shopcta__btn:hover,
  .he-shopcta__btn:focus-visible {
    background: #4a3428;
    border-color: #4a3428;
    color: #fff;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .he-shopcta {
      margin-bottom: 2.8rem;
      padding: 2rem 0;
    }

    .he-shopcta__line {
      font-size: 1.9rem;
    }

    .he-shopcta__actions {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .he-shopcta__btn {
      width: 100%;
      min-width: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
